### 1.3 Wiring, Integration & Test Alignment Issues (P1 - P2)

#### 🟢 Issue 08: Faulty Relative `.env` Path in AI Core (Checked)
- **Location:** [`core.js:L2`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/src/AI/versionOne/core.js#L2)
- **Description:** `path.resolve(__dirname, '../Automation/.env')` looks for `src/AI/Automation/.env`, which does not exist. The true relative path is `../../Automation/versionOne/.env`.

#### 🟠 Issue 09: Database Environment Variable Name Discrepancy
- **Location:** [`README.md:L139`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/README.md#L139) vs [`dataBase/index.js:L8`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/src/Automation/versionOne/model/dataBase/index.js#L8)
- **Description:** README instructs setting `MONGO_URI`, but database initialization expects `process.env.MongoDB`. Setup per documentation results in startup crash.

#### 🟠 Issue 10: Port 3000 Collision Between Express and Next.js
- **Location:** [`server.js:L22`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/src/Automation/versionOne/server.js#L22) & [`README.md:L151-L162`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/README.md#L151-L162)
- **Description:** Both services default to `PORT=3000`. Starting both on localhost triggers `EADDRINUSE`.
- **Fix:** Standardize backend on `PORT=5000` (or `PORT=3001`) and frontend on `3000`.

#### 🟠 Issue 11: Missing Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) Configuration
- **Location:** [`server.js:L24-L40`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/src/Automation/versionOne/server.js#L24-L40)
- **Description:** No `cors` middleware is registered. Browser fetch calls from Next.js (`http://localhost:3000`) to Express (`http://localhost:5000`) are blocked by standard SOP.

#### 🟠 Issue 12: Inverted Struct Member Initialization in Unit Tests
- **Location:** [`test_penetration_accuracy.cpp:L12`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/tests/versionOne/test_penetration_accuracy.cpp#L12), [`test_scenario_duplication.cpp:L11`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/tests/versionOne/test_scenario_duplication.cpp#L11), [`test_stress_performance.cpp:L11`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/tests/versionOne/test_stress_performance.cpp#L11)
- **Description:** Positional initializer passes `density = 0.03` and `rebar_volume_fraction = 2400.0`.
- **Fix:** Use C++20 designated initializers (`.density = 2400.0, .rebar_volume_fraction = 0.03`).

#### 🟠 Issue 13: Unreal Engine Bridge Method Signature Mismatch
- **Location:** [`MOPSimulatorComponent.cpp:L88`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/UnreaEngine/MOP_Simulator/MOPSimulatorComponent.cpp#L88)
- **Description:** Calls `Sim.simulate(RawScenario)` with 1 parameter, but `ImpactSimulator::simulate()` requires `(scenario, dropAircraft, atmos)`. Prevents UE module build.

#### 🟡 Issue 14: Seven Test Suites Omitted from Build Automations
- **Location:** [`Makefile:L27-L30`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/Makefile#L27-L30) & [`CMakeLists.txt:L37-L54`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/MOP-Simulator/backend/CMakeLists.txt#L37-L54)
- **Description:** Only 3 tests are compiled. 7 test suites in `tests/versionOne/` are orphaned from the build system.

