## 🏛️ Section 3: Target Architecture Blueprint

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph Client ["Next.js 16 Client Portal (Port 3000)"]
        UI1["Interactive Control Panel"]
        UI2["Native Three.js 3D Canvas"]
        UI3["Real-time Telemetry Charts"]
    end

    subgraph Gateway ["Express API Gateway & Security (Port 5000)"]
        G1["Helmet & CORS Guard"]
        G2["Rate Limiter & Zod Validator"]
        G3["BullMQ Job Queue Producer"]
    end

    subgraph Workers ["Async Compute Workers (Redis / Background)"]
        W1["Job Consumer / Orchestrator"]
        W2["Telemetry Streamer (SSE)"]
    end

    subgraph Engine ["Native C++23 Physics Kernel"]
        C1["mop_sim binary"]
        C2["Numerical Solvers (RK4, Forrestal, WAPM, Hugoniot)"]
        C3["Stdout Line-Delimited JSON"]
    end

    subgraph Storage ["Persistent State"]
        DB[("MongoDB Cluster")]
        RD[("Redis Broker")]
    end

    subgraph AI ["AI Intelligence Layer"]
        LLM["Google Gemini API (2.0 Flash)"]
    end

    UI1 -->|REST /pipeline| G1 --> G2 --> G3 --> RD
    RD --> W1
    W1 <-->|Hypothesis / Paper Synthesis| LLM
    W1 -->|Spawn with --json-input| C1 --> C2 --> C3
    C3 -->|Stream JSON Lines| W1
    W1 -->|Persist Results & Telemetry| DB
    W1 --> W2 -->|SSE Telemetry Stream| UI3
    DB -->|Fetch Visualizer Data| UI2
```